ONG 3 UNIQUE DESTINIES!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guardian</strong> - <strong>Magistrate</strong> - <strong>Bloodthirsty</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occultist</strong> - <strong>Sorcerer</strong> - <strong>Archmage</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Executioner</strong> - <strong>Justiciar</strong> - <strong>Reaper</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilgrim</strong> - <strong>Ansi\u00e3o</strong> - <strong>Inquisitor</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sentinel</strong> - <strong>Forest Warden</strong> - <strong>Major</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>SYSTEMS THAT MAKE THE DIFFERENCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Diversity</strong> \u2192 Monsters have species, sizes, elements - kill enough to register them in the Explorer's Album<br>\u2022 <strong>Equipment</strong> \u2192 Rare cards (dropped from monsters), accessories, refinements, gems<br>\u2022 <strong>Deep Customization</strong> \u2192 Change character appearance, skill effects<br>\u2022 <strong>Pets vs Mercenaries</strong> \u2192 Choose between passive buffs \ud83d\udc3e OR battle allies \u2694\ufe0f<br>\u2022 <strong>Multiple Professions</strong> \u2192 Gain attribute rewards by mastering each profession</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Build diversity</strong> \u2192 We have several types of builds with basic, secondary, constellation, and specialization attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3934530/extras/3c6c9a37b1296e17bec100b6355f3a06.avif?t=1759415505\" width=394 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>MEANINGFUL MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2192 Complex mentoring system (help new